    <string name="health_rationale_title">What Afya writes to Health Connect</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_body">Only the weight from each weigh-in, at the time you stood on the scale, and only after you switch sharing on in Afya. Body fat, muscle and the other figures are population estimates, so they are never written where other apps would show them as measurements.\n\nAfya reads nothing from Health Connect. Health Connect keeps its data on this phone; other apps you have allowed can read the weight there. Switch sharing off in Afya\'s You tab at any time, and remove the permission in Health Connect.</string>
