    <string name="about_summary">Reads the OKOK / Chipsea broadcast format directly. No account, no cloud sync, no advertising SDK.</string>
    <string name="version_format">v%1$s · %2$d weigh-ins on file</string>
    <string name="formula_note">Composition uses published population equations (Deurenberg, Hall, Mifflin–St Jeor, Yuki), not the vendor\'s impedance model.</string>
    <string name="about_purpose">Afya exists so that the number under your feet is enough: you step on, the scale broadcasts, and every figure it carries is decoded and kept on this phone.</string>
